# Repository Overview

React 19 + Vite 7 + TypeScript SPA. React Router 7 (library mode). Talks to a Python API backend.

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── assets/          # Static assets, CSS
├── components/
│   └── ui/          # shadcn/ui components (owned source, not node_modules)
├── lib/             # Shared utilities (e.g. cn() from utils.ts)
├── pages/           # Page-level components (e.g. auth/, dashboard/)
├── services/        # API services and HTTP client
├── stores/          # State (local hooks; no global state library)
├── types/           # TypeScript type definitions
public/              # Public static assets
e2e/                 # Playwright end-to-end tests
```

## Key Files

- `src/main.tsx` — entry point, BrowserRouter + route definitions
- `src/App.tsx` — root layout (nav + `<Outlet />`)
- `components.json` — shadcn/ui CLI configuration
